  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "How to run",
      "items": [
        "cd rust && cargo run --release --bin single_flip -- --L 12 [--phases 16] [--sites all|0,3,6] [--t-max 25] [--dt 0.1] [--seed 1] [--ent-dt Δ] [--ent-max L/2]",
        "Writes to data/ (or $SCARS_DATA_DIR) while it runs; also states_realization_L<L>.csv (c of every bond, same realization as states and states_traj)",
        "Analysis order: fit_states.py → fit_small_gamma.py → fit_states_inverse_L.py → single_kick.py; fit_channels.py → spreading.py; damage_fourier.py and lean_plan_analysis.py stand alone (all read data/used_data)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Key mechanics",
      "items": [
        "One run per (phase m, site k): spin k reversed in the xy plane of the noiseless product state at t′ = φ_m/h, then e^(−iHτ) only",
        "c_j = ⟨σˣ_j⟩ + i⟨σʸ_j⟩ divided by its noiseless value; D(0) = 2, and D stays 2 if H_I = 0",
        "All runs advance together one output step at a time (rayon); weak-γ prediction m_⊥(t) ≈ exp[−γ ∫₀ᵗ D̄(τ) dτ]",
        "single_flip_ent_*.csv is written with --ent-dt but no plot script reads it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Notes part",
      "items": [
        "Compile: latex/build_parts.sh single_kick → latex/parts/pdf/single_kick.pdf (full notes are built first; numbering as in latex/notes.tex)",
        "Model; Theory: weak dissipation, order of limits and finite-size cap",
        "Methods: notation, Pauli strings, pure states (trajectories and single flips), entanglement entropy, entanglement after a single flip, eigenvalues without LAPACK, run options and file names",
        "Single-kick test; lean runs: spreading of the damage and the scar rate as γ → 0, the order of limits (Mori) for the scar"
      ]
    }
  ]
